Statement of changes (Apache License, Version 2.0, Section 4(b))
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OrchidLights is a hard fork of QLC+ taken at commit 18cf9da99 (2026-08-10).
The full upstream git history is preserved in this repository, so every
modification made by this fork is visible as a commit after that point.

The substantive changes are:

  * The two inherited desktop user interfaces -- the Qt Widgets UI (ui/) and
    the Qt Quick UI (qmlui/) -- are frozen and slated for removal.
  * The legacy web remote (webaccess/) is being replaced by a new module
    (server/) providing a headless engine daemon with a REST and WebSocket API.
  * A new browser-based user interface (web/) is being added.
  * The application is renamed, and its installation and user data directories
    are renamed accordingly.

The lighting engine (engine/), the output plugins (plugins/) and the fixture
definition library (resources/) are inherited from QLC+ and continue to carry
their original copyright.

